<div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <header class="mb-16">
    <h1 class="mb-6 mt-0 text-balance text-5xl font-black leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.05em] sm:text-7xl">Calm starts young.</h1>
    <p class="mb-0 text-xl leading-snug font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 sm:text-2xl">Children learn to float, swim, glide and dive with an instructor beside them, one skill at a time.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="max-w-4xl">
    <div class="mb-14">
      <p class="mb-3 text-3xl font-black leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-5xl">The dive reflex starts in the pool.</p>
      <p class="mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 sm:text-xl">Hold your breath in water and your heart slows down on its own. The same response that keeps a diver calm at depth settles a child before a test, on a stage, at the end of a hard school day.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-14">
      <p class="mb-3 text-3xl font-black leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-5xl">One instructor, one child, full attention.</p>
      <p class="mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 sm:text-xl">Pool first. Open water once the basics are calm and automatic. No pushing for depth, no racing the clock.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <a href="https://instagram.com/nofinsfreediving" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn mt-6">Get in touch</a>
</div>
